      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "1. A: Qǐngwèn, cāntīng zài jǐlóu?    May I ask, on what floor is the\n                                      dining room?\n   B: Zài èrlóu.                     It's on the second floor.\n\nNotes on No. 1\n\nCāntīng is the word for the dining room of a hotel. A dining room in a house is a fàntīng, and an independent restaurant is a fànguǎnzi (fànguǎnr).\n\nJǐlóu is the question \"what floor,\" more literally, \"what-number floor.\"\n"
    }
